highlighted.pdf       3 pages of text.  Page 2: a yellow two-line highlight
                      with the note "Key definition" and a red highlight.
                      Page 3: a green underline and a sticky note.
highlighted-more.pdf  The same file after one more highlight was added in
                      another program: a blue highlight on page 3 with
                      the note "Branches".
Both were made with PyMuPDF, which writes standard /Highlight annotations
with QuadPoints, as Okular does when it saves annotations into a PDF.
outline.pdf           8 pages with a table of contents: Part 1 (p 1-4) with
                      Chapter 1 (p 1-2) and Chapter 2 (p 3-4); Part 2 (p 5-8)
                      with Chapter 3 (p 5-8).
lecture.opus          90 s of audio titled "Cardiology Lecture", with chapters
                      Introduction (0-30 s), The cardiac cycle (30-60 s) and
                      Heart sounds (60-90 s).  Made with ffmpeg.
lecture.m4a           The same as an .m4a with its index first (faststart),
                      so its duration is known when streamed over HTTP.
clip.mkv              6 s of ffmpeg's colour test pattern, 160x120, no audio.
diagram.png           A 64x48 PNG of the same pattern, for figure extracts.
comic.cbz             A comic of four 20x30 PNG pages, "Chapter 1/page1.png",
                      "page2.png", "page10.png" and "cover.png", plus a text
                      file and a macOS "__MACOSX/._cover.png" that are not pages.
comic.cb7             The same pages in a 7z archive, without the extras.
